    {
      "brand": "Nissan",
      "model": "Leaf",
      "gen": "ZE0 / AZE0",
      "years": [
        2010,
        2017
      ],
      "vin": [
        "^(JN1AZ0C|1N4AZ0C|SJNFAAZE0)"
      ],
      "engines": [
        {
          "code": "EM61 / EM57",
          "fuel": "electric"
        }
      ],
      "protocol": 6,
      "buses": {
        "ru": "CAN 11/500. Батарея (BMS) отвечает на 79B → 7BB по $21 (группы 01, 02, 04), зарядный блок и VCM — 797 → 79A. Стандартный Mode 01 даёт мало: машина электрическая.",
        "en": "CAN 11/500. The battery (BMS) answers on 79B → 7BB with $21 (groups 01, 02, 04), the charger and VCM on 797 → 79A. Standard Mode 01 gives little: the car is electric."
      },
      "note": {
        "ru": "Самый массовый электромобиль в России, в основном праворульный из Японии: VIN в блоках нет, модель узнаётся по ответу батарейного блока 79B. Батарея 24 кВт·ч (2010–2017) или 30 кВт·ч (2016–2017). Hx и ёмкость в А·ч — в «Все данные».",
        "en": "Russia's most common EV, mostly right-hand-drive imports from Japan: no VIN in the modules, the model is recognised by the battery module's answer on 79B. 24 kWh (2010–2017) or 30 kWh (2016–2017) battery. Hx and the capacity in Ah are under \"All data\"."
      },
      "match": [
        {
          "hdr": "79B",
          "rsp": "7BB",
          "svc": "21",
          "did": "01",
          "hex": "^([0-9A-F]{2} ){35,43}[0-9A-F]{2}$"
        }
      ],
      "src": [
        "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nissan_Leaf",
        "https://github.com/openvehicles/Open-Vehicle-Monitoring-System-3/blob/master/vehicle/OVMS.V3/components/vehicle_nissanleaf/src/vehicle_nissanleaf.cpp",
        "https://docs.openvehicles.com/en/latest/components/vehicle_nissanleaf/docs/index.html",
        "https://github.com/OBDb/Nissan-Leaf"
      ],
      "verified": false
    },
